{"id":"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md","title":"Gödel Set Undecidable","display":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable","aliases":["92-thm-godel-set-undecidable"],"display":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-godel-set-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (Gödel set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength condition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\)</span> : Gödel集不可判定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>是可证句子的Gödel数集</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>可判定，则可判定任意句子是否可证</li>\n<li>对有效且足够强的相容<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>可判定，就能有效构造与本质不完备性冲突的判定过程</li>\n<li>这是本质不完备性在定理码集合上的可判定性后果；从单个独立句的存在到统一不可判定性仍使用有效性与足够强度</li>\n<li>在同样的充分条件下，可另证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\\leq_m K\">\\(K_G\\leq_m K\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\leq_m K_G\">\\(K\\leq_m K_G\\)</span>；两条归约不是本断言仅凭名称自动包含的内容</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":